<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lend Lease to sell MLC Building unit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lend Lease to sell MLC Building unit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property and financial services group Lend Lease Corp said on Friday that its MLC unit had invited a number of suitable institutions to submit bids for the purchase of its building society.</p>
<p>MLC said in a statement that it was selling the building society, the fifth largest in Australia, to concentrate on its core funds management business.</p>
</text>
